<title>RUSSIA: Russia could issue rouble eurobond next year.</title>
<headline>Russia could issue rouble eurobond next year.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia could issue a rouble Eurobond next year, creating a new sector in the Euromarkets, Finance Minister Alexander Livshits said on Friday.</p>
<p>Earlier he told a news conference following Thursday's launch of Russia's first mark Eurobond that Russia intended to issue rouble paper alongside its dollar and mark issues.</p>
<p>Asked whether he meant a rouble Eurobond, he replied &quot;Yes.&quot;</p>
</text>
